Phoenix and was covering Aaron's death for their station. The reporter was seeking a statement from the couple about the fact that four years earlier two other teenagers had died in incidents at two separate Utah-based wilderness therapy programs, both of which had direct links to North Star expeditions. In mid-1990, California couple Cathy and Bob Sutton were desperate to help their daughter, 15-year-old Michelle. Michelle had been cheerful, creative and trusting, but her life was upended one night when she was hanging out with friends.

